d:Operation Dawn, annex entry 18. The Ash relay only acts on orders that carry command's seal, and command never puts its standing order on the wire.

<br>

We can file field reports to the relay and submit orders to it, but we do not hold command's key. Make the relay give up command's standing order anyway.

